<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Respironics upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Respironics upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Respironics Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Respironics gained 1 to 19 in late morning trading.</p>
</text>
